cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "GHADI: seismic detection of mass movements that cause cascading flood surges"
abstract: >-
  A research system for detecting, from open seismic stations, the slope failures that
  start cascading flood surges in transboundary Himalayan rivers, built around the
  26 August 2026 Bhote Koshi event. It is detection, not prediction. The positive class
  is one event, and every result states that limit.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GHADI project contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uditmahato/ghadi"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - seismology
  - landslide
  - flood early warning
  - Himalaya
  - Sentinel-1
